{"id":72120,"date":"2026-10-31T21:52:38","date_gmt":"2026-10-31T21:52:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72120"},"modified":"2026-10-31T22:55:03","modified_gmt":"2026-10-31T21:55:03","slug":"stc-ocr","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/stc-ocr\/","title":{"rendered":"Stc Ocr 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Stc Ocr 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Stc Ocr 2027<\/strong> (7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do <strong>STC Ultimate Obstacle Challenge<\/strong>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>4 de Abril de 2027<\/strong>, na cidade de <strong>Santiago do Cac\u00e9m<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>. Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o de atletas a partir das <strong>08:00<\/strong> e in\u00edcio das partidas por vagas \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> (com sa\u00eddas de 15 em 15 minutos) junto \u00e0 <strong>Capela de S\u00e3o Pedro no Passeio das Romeirinhas<\/strong>, esta prova de obst\u00e1culos combina resist\u00eancia em corrida, for\u00e7a e destreza t\u00e9cnica.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O tra\u00e7ado tem uma extens\u00e3o aproximada de <strong>8 km<\/strong> e desafia os participantes com cerca de <strong>38 obst\u00e1culos naturais e artificiais<\/strong> \u2014 incluindo transposi\u00e7\u00e3o de muros, subida a cordas e \u00e1rvores, transporte e arrasto de cargas, rastejamento e nata\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 distribu\u00eddos entre a zona hist\u00f3rica da cidade, o <strong>Parque do Rio da Figueira<\/strong> e a encosta envolvente ao <strong>Castelo de Santiago do Cac\u00e9m<\/strong>. O evento divide-se em duas vertentes: <strong>STC Elite<\/strong> (competitiva com chip e colete obrigat\u00f3rio, limitada a 170 vagas nas duas primeiras vagas de partida para Masculinos e Femininos, onde a falha num obst\u00e1culo implica elimina\u00e7\u00e3o competitiva) e <strong>STC Fun<\/strong> (participa\u00e7\u00e3o individual ou em equipa, sem cronometragem nem obrigatoriedade de transpor todos os obst\u00e1culos).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Os Chaparros BTT Team Associa\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong>, o evento disp\u00f5e de dois postos de abastecimento (a meio do percurso e na meta), kit de atleta com t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, servi\u00e7o de bengaleiro no recinto e banhos nos balne\u00e1rios do <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Desportos de Santiago do Cac\u00e9m<\/strong>, premiando a Geral e 10 escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios (dos 16 aos +60 anos) na vertente Elite, bem como a Equipa Mais Numerosa.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">4 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Capela de S\u00e3o Pedro no Passeio das Romeirinhas, Santiago do Cac\u00e9m, Set\u00fabal<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\