rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">OCR Open \/ Fun (Vagas a cada 15 min)<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">STC Fun \u2014 8 km + 38 Obst\u00e1culos (Individual ou Grupo \u2022 Lazer)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 de Abril de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> 1 abastecimento a meio do percurso (~Km 4) + 1 abastecimento final na meta<\/div><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 19,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11\/2026 a 07\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 23,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (08\/01\/2027 a 17\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 27,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/02\/2027 a 17\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 31,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/03\/2027 a 01\/04\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Stc Ocr 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do STC Ultimate Obstacle Challenge (Stc Ocr 2027) realiza-se no domingo, 4 de Abril de 2027, com partida e chegada junto \u00e0 Capela de S\u00e3o Pedro no Passeio das Romeirinhas, na cidade de Santiago do Cac\u00e9m (distrito de Set\u00fabal). A concentra\u00e7\u00e3o inicia-se \u00e0s 08:00 e as partidas arrancam \u00e0s 09:00 por vagas de atletas a cada 15 minutos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a diferen\u00e7a entre as vertentes STC Elite e STC Fun?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Ambas percorrem os cerca de 8 km com 38 obst\u00e1culos naturais e artificiais. A vertente STC Elite \u00e9 estritamente individual e competitiva (limitada a 170 vagas, com partida na 1\u00aa vaga para Masculinos e 2\u00aa vaga para Femininas), tem cronometragem por chip e uso obrigat\u00f3rio de colete STC, sendo obrigat\u00f3ria a supera\u00e7\u00e3o integral de todos os obst\u00e1culos sob pena de recolha do chip\/colete. A vertente STC Fun (individual ou em equipa) n\u00e3o \u00e9 cronometrada e privilegia a entreajuda, sem obriga\u00e7\u00e3o de completar todos os obst\u00e1culos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e as 4 fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Stc Ocr 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em 4 fases: 1\u00aa Fase (01\/11\/2026 a 07\/01\/2027) \u2014 24,00 \u20ac em STC Elite e 19,00 \u20ac em STC Fun; 2\u00aa Fase (08\/01 a 17\/02\/2027) \u2014 28,00 \u20ac em Elite e 23,00 \u20ac em Fun; 3\u00aa Fase (18\/02 a 17\/03\/2027) \u2014 32,00 \u20ac em Elite e 27,00 \u20ac em Fun; 4\u00aa Fase (18\/03 a 01\/04\/2027) \u2014 36,00 \u20ac em Elite e 31,00 \u20ac em Fun. A transfer\u00eancia de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para outro atleta \u00e9 permitida at\u00e9 17 de mar\u00e7o de 2027.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a idade m\u00ednima e que escal\u00f5es s\u00e3o premiados?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A idade m\u00ednima de participa\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 de 16 anos (menores de 18 anos devem entregar o termo de responsabilidade assinado pelo representante legal). Na vertente STC Elite s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios individuais masculinos e femininos \u00e0 Geral e aos escal\u00f5es 16-19, 20-24, 25-29, 30-34, 35-39, 40-44, 45-49, 50-54, 55-59 e +60 anos, al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9u para a Equipa Mais Numerosa.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de atleta e onde est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis bengaleiro e banhos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O kit de atleta inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial (tamanhos S a XXXL), dorsal identificativo, seguro desportivo, ofertas de parceiros e dois abastecimentos (a meio do percurso e na meta). O evento disp\u00f5e de bengaleiro no recinto da prova e de balne\u00e1rios com duches dispon\u00edveis no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Desportos de Santiago do Cac\u00e9m.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Stc Ocr 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-04\", \"endDate\": \"2027-04-04\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Capela de S\u00e3o Pedro no Passeio das Romeirinhas\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Santiago do Cac\u00e9m\", \"addressRegion\": \"Set\u00fabal\", \"a